And what is the official imprimatur?

NetHack is a bastard of Hack which is more or less a clone of Rogue.

Nobody ordered Jay Fenlason or Andries Brouwer to do Hack and nobody
gave Mike Stephenson the official blessing to do NetHack.

They just did it because they wanted to create or improve something
and they didn't need to wait for someones official declaration.


You can see this in the announcement of Mike Stephenson 20 years ago, as
he proposed to release a Hack 1.0.4 what would in time become NetHack:
